===== G3 ROOT-CAUSE PROBE (envaware_g3_probe.jl) =====
The full-star no-op-at-BIG dev=4.97e-9 (G3, ALS maxiter=50) is an ALS-CONVERGENCE
FLOOR, NOT a routing/composition error. Confirmed by swapping the truncation alg:
  ALS maxiter=50  tol=1e-12 : dev = 4.9674e-09  (per-arm fid deficit ~1e-12)
  ALS maxiter=300 tol=1e-14 : dev = 1.2261e-09  (tighter ALS -> 4x smaller)
  FullEnvTruncation (exact) : dev = 1.0547e-10  (per-arm fid ~1e-15)  <<< PASSES <1e-9
With the EXACT (non-iterative) truncation engine the full-star env-aware update
reproduces the bare lossless density to 1.05e-10, so ALL FOUR bonds (incl. both
VERTICAL bonds) are correctly composed. The earlier G3=false was the iterative
ALS residual (~1e-6/arm) compounding across 4 sequential arm truncations.

DECISIVE ROUTING GATES (independent of the ALS floor):
  G1 vertical env-VALUE oracle (transpose trick): up=5.99e-14, down=2.08e-14
  G2 per-dir single-bond no-op-at-BIG: R=5.6e-15 U=3.4e-13 L=2.7e-14 D=1.9e-15
Both pass cleanly -> the rotate-then-_qr_bond vertical routing is exact.

OVERALL VERDICT: VALIDATED. No-op-at-BIG passes for all 4 bonds (single-bond G2
and full-star with FullEnvTruncation). Vertical bonds composed. No SpaceMismatch.
